        of the Syrian refugees’ issue”. <em>Central European Journal of
        Politics</em> 3 (1): 1&ndash;25, 2017. English. The PDF was uploaded in
        November 2017, according to its web address.
        <a href="https://www.cejop.cz/wp-content/uploads/2017/11/2017_Vol-03_No-01_Art-01_Akbulat-FINAL.pdf">PDF</a>
      </li>
      <li id="src-chochiev">
        <strong>Georgy V. Chochiev</strong> (Чочиев Г. В.), “Circassian
        colonization in Ottoman Syria in the second half of the 19th &ndash;
        early 20th century” (<span lang="ru">Черкесская колонизация в
        османской Сирии…</span>). <em>Historical, Philosophical, Political and
        Legal Sciences, Culturology and Art Studies</em>, Tambov: Gramota, 2015,
        No. 11 (61), part 3, pp. 202&ndash;205. Russian. I read the
        five-page PDF.
        <a href="https://www.gramota.net/article/hss20152655/pdf">PDF</a>
      </li>
      <li id="src-mirzoeva">
        <strong>S. G. Mirzoeva and E. Kh. Apazheva</strong> (Мирзоева С. Г.,
        Апажева Е. Х.), “Resettlement of Circassians in the Arab regions of the
