        <a href={`${research}/kushkhabiev-circassian-community-in-syria/`}>Circassian community in Syria</a>.
        <a href="https://orsam.org.tr/dosya/Analiz_130_eng.pdf">PDF</a>
      </li>
      <li id="src-lash">
        <strong>Adel Abdel Salam (Lash)</strong>, “<span lang="ar" dir="rtl">الشركس في سورية</span>”
        (“The Circassians in Syria”), <em>Syrian Contemporary History</em>
        (<span lang="ar" dir="rtl">التاريخ السوري المعاصر</span>). Published
